    {
      "id": "t095",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Text badges are authoritative.** Colour reinforces them and never carries meaning alone. Statuses are always written out so a colour-blind reader and a screen reader get the same answer.\n\n**No duplicate technical truth** · **no metadata on source files** · **status words mean evidence** · **never delete history**.",
      "x": -1120,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 2850,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#92400e"
